# The data packs land here. They are ~125MB, they are not this repository's to
# redistribute (see ../NOTICE.md), and they are reproducible with:
#
#   npm run fetch-data
#
# manifest.json IS tracked: its hashes are reviewed in a pull request and pinned
# to the code that expects them, which is what makes a swapped release asset
# fail loudly instead of quietly serving the wrong verses.
*
!.gitignore
!manifest.json
